      "message": "feat(fixtures): generate 3-jaw, 4-jaw and collet lathe chucks\n\nThree new built-in accessory kinds, generated from their figures as\nclosed steel shells (camcraft_sim::chuck): body with through bore and\n2..12 jaws, or a collet nose over a body. Validated at command creation\n(non-finite, zero or negative figures, a bore past the body, jaws past\nthe body or meeting each other, a collet bore past the nose - all by\nname). A new OnStock placement (MCP fit_to_stock) closes a chuck on the\nsetup's round stock. The lathe holder law and the post gate read the\nchuck like any fixture.\n\nRefs #1442\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
